participants: User, App, Identity provider
User -> App: click "Sign in"
App --> User: redirect with code_challenge (PKCE)
User -> Identity provider: log in, approve scopes
Identity provider --> User: redirect back with one-time code
User -> App: deliver code
App -> Identity provider: code + code_verifier
Identity provider --> App: access token, ID token, refresh token
App -> Identity provider: later: call API with access token
